+> docker run -v "$(pwd):/code" -w /code sokrates init
+
+### Landscape report
+
+The landscape report aggregates the analyses found under an analysis root. Create or refresh it with:
+> java -jar sokrates.jar analyzeLandscape -analysisRoot <folder>
+
+`analyzeLandscape` creates `<folder>/_sokrates_landscape/config.json` and the landscape report (`index.html`). It is the landscape counterpart of the analysis commands. `updateLandscape` is the same command under its older name and is kept for existing scripts.
+
+Run `java -jar sokrates.jar analyzeLandscape -help` for all options.
\ No newline at end of file
